# basePath Chapter6

::FirstContractOpenCh6
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 


{@Player}   P.A.L., any updates on what's happening at Kalvis?
{@PAL}      Frontier Robotics reports a minor disruption to mining operations on Cu-6355-29.
{@PAL}      Production has resumed and output remains within acceptable parameters!
{@Player}   That's not what I'm hearing.
{@PAL}      Worker safety is a top priority! Winkler Station has transitioned to a fully autonomous workforce.
{@PAL}      With no human workers, workplace injuries have been reduced to zero!
{@Player}   ...Right.
{@PAL}      Shall we get back to work? You have three contracts to choose from.


::BeforeSupplyChainCh6
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Player}	Hey Xavier, do you have any leads on new sources for semiconductors?
{@Xavier}   Hey... uh... Locke...
{@Xavier}   Right. Winkler Station just opened up with germanium!
{@Xavier}   First fully autonomous station in my sector. Profits are gonna soar!
{@Xavier}   Workers reassigned. Ah, the beauty of automation!
{@Xavier}   Soon the only people we'll need are people like us.
{@Player}   Like us?
{@Xavier}   Managers! We have the good life, eh?

// hang up

{@Player}   ...does Frontier want to make everything autonomous?


